Package: qa-sentinels
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, python3
Description: local QA Sentinels monitoring and evidence CLI
 QA Sentinels periodically samples the host, examines journal and crash
 records, and organizes the results into findings, reports, evidence bundles
 and ticket drafts.
 .
 This package installs the QA Sentinels CLI and a read-only seed tree. The
 first invocation of /usr/bin/qa creates a per-user workspace at
 ~/QA-Sentinels unless one already exists. It never overwrites an existing
 checkout. Scheduling is not enabled automatically; use `qa install-cron` or
 let the QA Dashboard manage the fallback cycle.
